Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: svent-bspwm
Architecture: all
Depends: sv-icon-theme (>= 0.1.3), bspwm, sxhkd, polybar, rofi, kitty, dunst, python3, python3-pil, zsh,
 libnotify-bin, fonts-jetbrains-mono, pulseaudio-utils, iproute2,
 svent-core, svent-artwork, picom, feh, xclip, x11-xserver-utils,
 x11-utils, network-manager, xdg-user-dirs, greybird-gtk-theme, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: flameshot, playerctl, brightnessctl, pavucontrol, i3lock,
 zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, bat, imagemagick
Suggests: betterlockscreen
Conflicts: sv-bspwm
Replaces: sv-bspwm
Provides: sv-bspwm
Description: Svent OS bspwm session defaults
 Default bspwm session for Svent OS: window manager rules, sxhkd keybindings,
 a Polybar bar with status scripts, Dunst notifications, Picom compositor, a
 Kitty terminal using zsh, and Rofi menus. Bundled fonts are registered with
 fontconfig and the defaults are deployed to root and existing users on install.
